WEBVTT

00:05.922 --> 00:09.175
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.618 --> 00:37.579
[melancholy music playing]

00:37.662 --> 00:40.540
[rustling footsteps]

00:56.097 --> 00:57.849
Seo Yul of the Seo family.

01:00.018 --> 01:01.436
Don't come near me ever again.

01:03.980 --> 01:05.148
[gasps]

01:08.068 --> 01:09.069
If I see you again,

01:10.820 --> 01:12.238
I won't hesitate to kill you.

01:17.410 --> 01:18.578
[gasps] Please wait.

01:44.604 --> 01:47.440
[Seo Yul] Back then,
I could not stop her from leaving.

01:49.025 --> 01:50.443
I could not even ask her why.

01:51.945 --> 01:54.697
The moment my heart was cut down
by her blade,

01:56.616 --> 01:59.285
the time we had together
could not even become memories.

02:00.578 --> 02:03.081
Instead, I buried them deep inside.

02:03.748 --> 02:04.749
[Seo Yul sighs]

02:09.796 --> 02:12.966
What are you doing up so early?
And what are you doing out here?

02:17.428 --> 02:18.388
Mu-deok.

02:19.639 --> 02:21.558
I could ask you the very same thing.

02:23.768 --> 02:26.104
I caught a bird, so that I can cook it.

02:29.232 --> 02:30.483
I don't enjoy eating. Don't worry.

02:30.567 --> 02:32.527
I'll make rice with chestnuts too.

02:33.820 --> 02:36.156
The chestnuts here in Danhyanggok
are very sweet.

02:39.951 --> 02:42.662
[young Naksu] The chestnuts in Danhyanggok
are very sweet.

02:42.745 --> 02:44.956
[soft music playing]

02:55.925 --> 02:57.218
I don't enjoy sweet things either.

03:00.805 --> 03:02.765
However much you dislike them,
you could have just declined.

03:02.849 --> 03:05.226
A single gesture from you
could kill someone like me, you know.

03:07.937 --> 03:09.063
Do not exaggerate.

03:10.315 --> 03:13.484
Although I may dislike them,
I would not kill you over it.

03:14.068 --> 03:15.695
You really do not like them, huh?

03:15.778 --> 03:17.697
[Seo Yul] There is no need for you
to prepare breakfast.

03:17.780 --> 03:19.240
We will leave once Dang-gu wakes up.

03:19.824 --> 03:21.868
If you do not wish to eat,
then just leave.

03:38.509 --> 03:39.886
I thought you were getting ready to leave.

03:42.013 --> 03:44.682
I've changed my mind, so please, serve me.

03:45.391 --> 03:46.392
You said you didn't want it.

03:46.976 --> 03:49.270
I never said I didn't want it.
Don't twist my words.

03:52.065 --> 03:53.566
Since you had a lot to drink yesterday,

03:53.650 --> 03:56.319
I imagine that you would
still be feeling unwell, so,

03:56.402 --> 03:58.947
I said that because I did not wish
to burden you on our account.

04:00.281 --> 04:01.241
I understand.

04:02.200 --> 04:05.036
I guess I had better rinse
some more rice for you.

04:05.119 --> 04:05.954
Where's the rice?

04:06.537 --> 04:09.249
- I will do it.
- Have you cooked rice before?

04:09.332 --> 04:11.000
I admit that I have not,

04:11.084 --> 04:12.627
I will be able to do it
if you explain how.

04:13.836 --> 04:15.171
It is quite simple.

04:16.005 --> 04:20.134
First, you rinse it around, then pour in
a decent amount of water, and boil it.

04:21.678 --> 04:23.346
Then you let it sit for some time.

04:25.181 --> 04:26.891
[hesitates] It does seem simple.

04:34.732 --> 04:36.109
[Mu-deok] Oh.

04:36.192 --> 04:38.069
You said you could do it
if I just explained to you how!

04:38.152 --> 04:39.862
You said cooking it seemed simple!

04:41.406 --> 04:44.492
It was not as simple as it seemed.
I'm sorry about that.

04:45.243 --> 04:47.704
[Mu-deok] Gosh, this is--
What do I do with this?

04:47.787 --> 04:49.372
You burnt all of it!
[sighs]

04:50.164 --> 04:52.250
Since it was my fault,
let me make it up to you.

04:53.835 --> 04:55.378
Those vegetables need chopping, right?

04:55.461 --> 04:56.879
Teach me how I should chop them for you.

04:57.797 --> 05:00.383
- [whimsical music playing]
- [Mu-deok sighs]

05:01.676 --> 05:02.885
[Mu-deok] Ugh, what do we do with this?

05:02.969 --> 05:04.095
- Such a waste.
- Oh my god.

05:11.352 --> 05:12.603
[Jang Uk] Hey, Dang-gu.

05:13.896 --> 05:14.731
Hey.

05:15.356 --> 05:16.941
Before you leave,
you should consider bathing.

05:17.025 --> 05:18.901
It has mineral water,
so your skin will be nice.

05:18.985 --> 05:20.361
Have some breakfast too.

05:20.903 --> 05:21.988
Well.

05:22.071 --> 05:24.198
Mu-deok's making breakfast
with Yul, together.

05:25.616 --> 05:26.492
- Together?
- [Dang-gu] Mm-hmm.

05:26.576 --> 05:28.870
[in sing-song tone]
Yul is cooking with Mu-deok, together.

05:29.537 --> 05:31.039
[Dang-gu giggles]

05:39.505 --> 05:41.132
Oh goodness.

05:41.215 --> 05:44.927
I told you
to cut the green onions into big pieces.

05:49.932 --> 05:51.017
- This big though?
- [Mu-deok] No.

05:51.851 --> 05:54.395
Do you not understand what "big" mean?

05:54.479 --> 05:55.897
"Big", as in "large".

05:58.316 --> 06:00.026
[Seo Yul] "Big", as in "large".

06:00.109 --> 06:03.196
[huffs]
No! Those are too small. Too small.

06:05.031 --> 06:05.907
[Mu-deok] Hmm?

06:06.574 --> 06:09.911
Big… pieces… like that.

06:11.245 --> 06:14.123
Well, you should have told me
the exact size.

06:14.207 --> 06:16.501
How am I supposed to know
what you mean by a "big piece", huh?

06:16.584 --> 06:19.629
[sighs] I can't believe
that the best mage of Jeongjingak

06:19.712 --> 06:21.923
cannot even differentiate
between a big and small piece.

06:22.006 --> 06:23.007
I mean, seriously.

06:24.467 --> 06:27.470
Forget it. You can just go pour
a bowl of water into that soup.

06:35.645 --> 06:36.479
Uh…

06:37.522 --> 06:39.190
okay, but which bowl do you mean?

06:41.484 --> 06:42.819
This one?

06:45.863 --> 06:48.491
Or do you mean… this one?

06:48.574 --> 06:49.492
[sighs]

06:51.202 --> 06:52.328
The small one.

06:56.791 --> 06:57.959
[Jang Uk chuckles]

06:58.751 --> 07:01.504
Why does it seem like
Mu-deok is yelling at Yul?

07:02.380 --> 07:03.422
Is she really in love with him?

07:03.923 --> 07:05.383
That is the type of girl she is.

07:05.883 --> 07:09.595
She's not one who feels shy
in front of anyone.

07:12.974 --> 07:16.060
[Dang-gu] Goodness me. Seo Yul.

07:16.853 --> 07:19.564
Despite being scolded by Mu-deok,
he is still doing his best to learn.

07:22.525 --> 07:24.068
- To learn?
- Look at them.

07:24.777 --> 07:26.571
Hey, I said that was enough. Hey!

07:27.947 --> 07:29.407
I do not enjoy salty food.

07:30.116 --> 07:31.075
[Mu-deok sighs]

07:33.244 --> 07:35.329
- [Dang-gu] He has never been like that.
- Taste it.

07:35.413 --> 07:37.415
[Dang-gu] Not even in front of
Master Heo or my uncle.

07:37.498 --> 07:38.708
How interesting.

07:38.791 --> 07:41.210
Does he not remind you
of an intimidated pupil

07:41.294 --> 07:42.211
in front of his master?

07:42.295 --> 07:43.671
[Mu-deok] The soup is bland.

07:43.754 --> 07:44.714
Ugh, you see?

07:44.797 --> 07:47.008
You should have stopped pouring water
when I told you to.

07:47.592 --> 07:49.719
- [Seo Yul] I'm sorry.
- [Dang-gu] A cute master.

07:49.802 --> 07:51.095
And her diligent pupil.

07:51.179 --> 07:52.054
[Mu-deok sighs]

07:52.138 --> 07:54.432
[Mu-deok] It should be fine.
Just needs to boil down.

07:54.515 --> 07:56.058
A master and her pupil?

07:56.142 --> 07:59.187
I mean, don't be so stubborn!
This is your first time.

07:59.270 --> 08:01.230
You don't know
what you're doing right now.

08:04.317 --> 08:07.945
[eastern-style dramatic music playing]

08:08.529 --> 08:09.363
[Dang-gu] All right.

08:09.447 --> 08:13.075
So, shall we taste it to see
how well Mu-deok taught you how to cook?

08:13.701 --> 08:15.161
And find out if you learned?

08:20.541 --> 08:21.834
Oh, it's so good!

08:21.918 --> 08:23.211
It is good?

08:25.588 --> 08:27.840
I tasted it every now and then
as Mu-deok instructed.

08:31.135 --> 08:32.011
You did good.

08:33.262 --> 08:35.890
You must be thrilled to receive
a compliment from your master, Yul.

08:35.973 --> 08:38.184
I have been called a prodigy
my entire life,

08:38.267 --> 08:39.769
so I thought I was good at everything.

08:40.561 --> 08:42.730
Today, I learned
there are things I'm not good at.

08:42.813 --> 08:43.773
[Seo Yul] Mu-deok.

08:43.856 --> 08:45.483
Thank you for helping me realize this.

08:45.566 --> 08:46.817
It was quite frustrating

08:46.901 --> 08:49.737
because he could not understand
what I was telling him.

08:49.820 --> 08:52.490
But he still showed the determination
to try till the end.

08:53.157 --> 08:54.825
That is
why I did not give up on teaching him.

08:56.369 --> 08:57.745
[scoffs] Look at you.

08:58.371 --> 09:00.665
If anyone heard you talk,
they'd think he cooked for the King.

09:00.748 --> 09:03.543
Actually, you can learn a lot
from making one meal.

09:03.626 --> 09:05.211
- You should learn as well.
- [Jang Uk] I'm not sure.

09:05.294 --> 09:08.005
Unlike someone, I do not have
a great master to teach me.

09:10.091 --> 09:11.926
Sorry, Uk, the rice is a bit burnt.

09:12.009 --> 09:12.885
Mm-hmm.

09:12.969 --> 09:14.720
[Dang-gu] Well, you can just learn
how to do it again.

09:14.804 --> 09:18.224
Hey, Mu-deok, do you think
Yul can do better?

09:18.307 --> 09:20.351
He is not completely hopeless.

09:21.018 --> 09:22.603
[Seo Yul] Thank you for deeming me so.

09:22.687 --> 09:23.729
[Mu-deok chuckles softly]

09:26.399 --> 09:27.400
[sighs]

09:37.660 --> 09:38.995
[Jang Uk]
Why are you washing the dishes alone?

09:39.078 --> 09:41.205
[Jang Uk] Why don't you ask
your star pupil to help with the dishes?

09:41.289 --> 09:43.291
Seo Yul prepared the meal for us,
so of course

09:43.374 --> 09:45.001
the servant ought to clean up on her own.

09:46.377 --> 09:48.004
Did you enjoy teaching him how to cook?

09:48.588 --> 09:51.549
You wish that…
Yul was your pupil instead?

09:51.632 --> 09:53.634
It would be easier
if Seo Yul were my pupil.

09:54.218 --> 09:56.304
[Mu-deok] He's diligent
and obeys his master.

09:57.096 --> 09:59.265
And he is not lazy
or reckless like someone I know.

09:59.348 --> 10:01.851
Hey, Master, don't cheat on me.

10:03.394 --> 10:04.312
What?

10:04.395 --> 10:06.647
No matter how much you desire
a diligent and obedient pupil,

10:06.731 --> 10:09.066
I'm to remain your one and only pupil.

10:09.150 --> 10:10.693
A master should never have two pupils.

10:10.776 --> 10:12.612
Just as a pupil
should never have two masters!

10:12.695 --> 10:14.447
Are you getting angry with me right now

10:14.530 --> 10:15.906
because I taught Yul
how to cook breakfast?

10:15.990 --> 10:18.492
Huh? Yes, I am angry.
How dare you teach some other guy

10:18.576 --> 10:20.036
when you have a pupil
who is alive and well?

10:20.620 --> 10:22.788
[Jang Uk] If you're going to teach someone
how to cook, teach me.

10:22.872 --> 10:25.541
- Teaching him is betrayal and cheating.
- Ah. [scoffs]

10:25.625 --> 10:27.668
I can try to understand
how it can be a betrayal,

10:27.752 --> 10:29.587
but that's cheating to you?

10:29.670 --> 10:30.963
[Mu-deok] I'm speechless.

10:34.425 --> 10:35.301
I thought that…

10:36.260 --> 10:38.220
I sensed cheating in the air.

10:38.304 --> 10:40.806
[soft harmonious music playing]

10:45.603 --> 10:46.562
What was that?

10:47.980 --> 10:50.566
- What now?
- Oh, uh, Mu-deok, do not cheat on me.

10:50.650 --> 10:52.068
I feel so hurt and upset about it.

10:52.151 --> 10:54.945
I cannot believe that I have a pupil
who is so possessive like this.

10:55.655 --> 10:58.115
Fine, I understand.
From now on, my only pupil

10:58.199 --> 11:00.743
will be you who spews nothing but nonsense
first thing in the morning. Happy?

11:00.826 --> 11:02.411
- But--
- [Dang-gu] Mu-deok!

11:03.663 --> 11:04.997
[Dang-gu] Mu-deok!

11:06.082 --> 11:06.916
Young Master,

11:07.833 --> 11:11.337
if I address others as Young Masters
and if I follow them around,

11:12.213 --> 11:13.297
is that cheating too?

11:13.381 --> 11:15.299
No. Well, that simply cannot be helped.

11:15.383 --> 11:17.718
But the other young masters,
be a bit, um--

11:17.802 --> 11:20.221
Oh, indifferent, yeah?

11:22.264 --> 11:23.933
- What a horse shit.
- [dishes clacking]

11:25.893 --> 11:29.355
[in cheerful voice]
Young Master Park! I hear you!

11:29.438 --> 11:32.483
Mu-deok, I said you are upsetting me!
Be indifferent!

11:39.448 --> 11:40.366
[Dang-gu] Whoa.

11:41.409 --> 11:43.494
Now that is tall.

11:44.912 --> 11:47.373
Yul, is this the tree
you kept talking about this whole time?

11:47.456 --> 11:49.959
- [harmonious music playing]
- [Seo Yul] I think it is.

11:51.710 --> 11:53.421
I cannot believe it really exists.

12:01.512 --> 12:04.515
How did you know that I was injured?

12:05.307 --> 12:08.018
There is a tall tree up on the hill.

12:09.937 --> 12:13.566
If you climb to the top of that tree,
you can see all of Danhyanggok.

12:18.779 --> 12:21.532
From the top of that tree,
you can see all of Danhyanggok.

12:25.077 --> 12:26.996
So, does that mean…

12:28.330 --> 12:29.415
you've been up there before, Mu-deok?

12:33.586 --> 12:36.380
I meant it's likely, since it is so tall.

12:38.257 --> 12:40.009
Then, do you want to go up?

12:40.509 --> 12:42.178
Want me to carry you up there?

12:42.845 --> 12:45.473
Hey, Dang-gu,
how are you going to climb that tree?

12:45.556 --> 12:48.893
To get all the way up there, Chisu…
Chisu is the least you should master.

12:50.227 --> 12:51.145
[Dang-gu] You think so?

12:51.770 --> 12:53.272
[Seo Yul]
You think I should give it a try?

12:53.355 --> 12:54.857
[Dang-gu exhales excitedly]
Oh, yes!

12:54.940 --> 12:56.859
You might be able
to make it to the top, Yul.

12:57.610 --> 12:59.320
Mu-deok, you want to go up with him?

12:59.403 --> 13:01.530
[whimsical music playing]

13:02.656 --> 13:03.532
Would you like to go up?

13:09.079 --> 13:10.206
No, thanks.

13:10.289 --> 13:13.334
I don't want to climb to the top
of such a special tree with just anyone.

13:18.255 --> 13:19.131
Anyone?

13:20.508 --> 13:22.176
[Dang-gu laughs]

13:22.259 --> 13:25.471
Oh gosh, I guess Mu-deok is too afraid
to climb to the top, huh?

13:26.055 --> 13:28.557
[Dang-gu] We should go. Come on.
Let us go. Come on.

13:31.727 --> 13:32.561
[chuckles]

13:38.442 --> 13:40.194
[Jin] I have examined
the core of his energy.

13:40.277 --> 13:41.612
CORE OF ENERGY:
THE CENTER OF A BODY'S ENERGY

13:41.695 --> 13:44.323
He was not a mage capable of spells.
He was just a commoner.

13:44.406 --> 13:48.494
Then, I am certain there are
more victims like this one.

13:48.577 --> 13:52.289
This means
that Soul Shifters are lurking among us.

13:52.790 --> 13:54.500
What do you think we should do, Master?

13:54.583 --> 13:57.378
Instead of capturing
any lurking Soul Shifters,

13:57.461 --> 13:59.713
you should find the origin of the sorcery.

13:59.797 --> 14:01.340
I suspect Cheonbugwan is behind all this.

14:03.175 --> 14:06.178
This one, who recently managed
to infiltrate Songrim,

14:07.096 --> 14:09.640
was also a Cheonbugwan
constellation recorder mage.

14:10.182 --> 14:12.810
And the one who erased all traces of Naksu

14:12.893 --> 14:14.770
and her mages after they all died is

14:15.646 --> 14:17.481
the Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu
of Cheonbugwan.

14:19.024 --> 14:20.276
Naksu?

14:20.359 --> 14:22.570
[tense music playing]

14:27.616 --> 14:30.369
[Sang-ho] We were able to identify
the body with the possessions he had.

14:30.452 --> 14:31.579
Who is he?

14:31.662 --> 14:34.039
He was a low-ranking servant
who worked for Cheonbugwan.

14:34.123 --> 14:37.585
Huh? I knew it was him!
Cheonbugwan did it again!

14:37.668 --> 14:40.337
I will go and confront
that scoundrel Jin Mu.

14:40.421 --> 14:42.089
Fo-- follow me, Sang-ho.

14:42.172 --> 14:43.299
Yeom!

14:43.966 --> 14:44.925
Yes?

14:45.759 --> 14:46.719
Do not do anything.

14:47.386 --> 14:48.512
[gasping]

14:49.096 --> 14:51.724
In your youth,
you used to act so recklessly.

14:51.807 --> 14:53.893
You may have aged,
but that temper of yours is still there.

14:54.810 --> 14:56.478
I am sorry, Master.

14:57.146 --> 14:58.272
Now is not the best time.

14:58.355 --> 15:02.234
For now, we must observe them discreetly.

15:02.818 --> 15:03.694
Well, Jin.

15:04.862 --> 15:06.739
You sure have grown up well, huh?

15:07.615 --> 15:09.658
[Master Lee] I still remember
when you were in a diaper.

15:09.742 --> 15:11.535
When did you grow up so fast, hmm?

15:11.619 --> 15:13.662
- Leading your people?
- [Jin chuckles shyly]

15:13.746 --> 15:15.998
[whimsical music playing]

15:16.916 --> 15:18.792
[gasps]
Uh, Master!

15:18.876 --> 15:20.044
[Heo Yeom chuckling awkwardly]

15:25.132 --> 15:26.675
My Lord, who is that man?

15:28.218 --> 15:29.178
Master Lee.

15:29.970 --> 15:31.138
That man was the former pupil

15:31.221 --> 15:33.641
of Master Seo Gyeong,
the founder of Songrim.

15:33.724 --> 15:35.768
[laughs softly]
But he looks so young, my Lord.

15:37.186 --> 15:38.270
He is not young.

15:39.229 --> 15:42.232
I vividly remember singing…
[chuckles]

15:43.192 --> 15:44.944
…at his 100th birthday party.

15:48.572 --> 15:49.782
I even danced like this.

15:53.911 --> 15:56.705
[Heo Yeom]
Is this Sapsali dog really Gwigu?

15:57.748 --> 15:58.832
[Heo Yeom laughs]

15:58.916 --> 16:00.626
So it was you, Master,

16:00.709 --> 16:04.296
who took Gwigu from Jinyowon.
[chuckles]

16:04.380 --> 16:06.715
He's the only one
who can find the Soul Shifter.

16:07.591 --> 16:10.344
Did you say the one
who died while soul shifting was Naksu?

16:10.427 --> 16:11.470
[Heo Yeom] Yes.

16:11.553 --> 16:14.431
She was a notorious assassin,
very skilled in spells.

16:16.892 --> 16:19.353
Was that Naksu's soul
that I sensed in her body?

16:20.062 --> 16:22.815
[suspenseful music playing]

16:31.740 --> 16:34.201
The one who has the sword
of the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan

16:34.284 --> 16:35.744
is his son, Jang Uk, yes?

16:35.828 --> 16:40.374
Yes. Did you meet Uk
while on your way to Songrim?

16:40.958 --> 16:44.420
Before I arrived, I met a boy
with a binding bracelet on his arm

16:44.503 --> 16:45.587
and his servant.

16:46.588 --> 16:48.424
Hmm. How interesting.

16:52.511 --> 16:53.554
[Dang-gu sighs]

16:55.723 --> 16:58.267
Mu-deok packed us some chestnuts.

16:58.350 --> 17:00.978
Yes, enjoy it. They are nice.
Be sure to give some to Maidservant Kim.

17:01.061 --> 17:01.937
Okay.

17:02.896 --> 17:04.064
Hmm.

17:04.148 --> 17:05.107
[Dang-gu] Uh…

17:09.695 --> 17:11.030
[Dang-gu] Wait.

17:11.113 --> 17:12.489
Why did you bring
your father's sword with you?

17:13.282 --> 17:15.367
Oh, that? Um, Mu-deok brought it here.

17:15.451 --> 17:18.328
Why bring this precious sword
if you aren't going to train with it?

17:19.288 --> 17:20.664
Should I take it to Maidservant Kim?

17:22.583 --> 17:25.753
You will never be…

17:27.171 --> 17:28.297
his son.

17:28.380 --> 17:31.216
[melancholy music playing]

17:31.884 --> 17:32.926
Yeah, you can take it.

17:33.510 --> 17:34.344
Hmm.

17:37.139 --> 17:38.390
- We should go.
- [Dang-gu] Sure.

17:41.185 --> 17:43.645
You came to Danhyanggok often
to pick herbs, right?

17:44.980 --> 17:48.442
Have you ever encountered someone
who lived here?

17:48.942 --> 17:51.945
Not yet. Who would want
to live in a place like this?

17:53.572 --> 17:54.573
[Seo Yul] Ah, I see.

17:59.536 --> 18:00.412
And…

18:02.539 --> 18:04.666
is Danhyanggok very cold in the winter?

18:06.126 --> 18:07.127
Why do you ask?

18:09.838 --> 18:11.548
I have never come here during the winter.

18:14.426 --> 18:16.428
I always got worried
when it started snowing.

18:18.222 --> 18:20.015
I got worried if it was too cold.

18:21.767 --> 18:23.852
Or if everything was covered in snow.

18:27.523 --> 18:28.899
[sighs softly]

18:30.109 --> 18:32.152
[soft music playing]

18:32.236 --> 18:33.362
[sighs]

18:34.321 --> 18:35.864
Winter in Danhyanggok is…

18:37.199 --> 18:38.951
much warmer than you would think.

18:42.287 --> 18:45.040
As soon as the sun rises,
the snow tends to melt pretty quickly.

18:48.210 --> 18:49.920
Thank you. I am relieved.

18:56.218 --> 18:58.470
[Mu-deok] There's plenty of food
to eat in the winter,

18:59.513 --> 19:02.099
and many places to take refuge.

19:04.393 --> 19:07.354
- [Dang-gu] These chestnuts will be tasty,
- Yes, they are really nice.

19:08.355 --> 19:10.566
[gasps] Wow.

19:10.649 --> 19:11.733
Should we stay another day?

19:12.317 --> 19:13.318
[Dang-gu] Hmm?

19:13.402 --> 19:15.612
Mu-deok must really like him.

19:20.450 --> 19:22.119
I mean, Mu-deok does not like him.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.413
She does not, okay?

19:24.496 --> 19:26.456
It's obvious that she does,
I'm telling ya.

19:27.875 --> 19:30.335
Look, Uk.
The way she looks at the two of us

19:30.419 --> 19:33.130
and the way she looks at Yul
are completely different.

19:33.672 --> 19:36.592
[soft harmonious music playing]

19:41.430 --> 19:42.806
I can still sense it in the air.

19:46.685 --> 19:48.353
[wind howling]

19:51.732 --> 19:52.983
Is it coming from over there?

19:57.070 --> 19:58.030
Dang-gu, let's go.

19:58.655 --> 19:59.573
Got it.

20:03.535 --> 20:05.787
[Dang-gu sighs] Goodbye.
Take care of Mu-deok.

20:11.251 --> 20:12.294
[Dang-gu] Come on.

20:13.921 --> 20:15.088
[sighs]

20:17.382 --> 20:18.300
[huffs]

20:19.676 --> 20:21.303
I will go see them off, okay?
[clears throat]

20:21.386 --> 20:23.931
[whimsical music playing]

20:27.184 --> 20:28.060
[scoffs]

20:34.149 --> 20:36.151
- [Jang Uk] Safe travels.
- [Seo Yul] Bye, Uk.

20:37.236 --> 20:39.279
Try to remember
where you lost your Spirit Plaque.

20:39.863 --> 20:41.949
- I will.
- [Dang-gu] And lie low.

20:42.449 --> 20:44.618
The Unanimous Assembly
gathered because of you.

20:44.701 --> 20:47.621
I assume all 12 of my former masters
were in attendance then?

20:47.704 --> 20:50.374
[Dang-gu] They'd all been your masters,
but they were so heartless.

20:51.208 --> 20:54.086
They even brought up the idea
of cutting off your energy flow.

20:54.920 --> 20:57.089
- Why would they even bring that up?
- What?

20:59.591 --> 21:01.343
Because you're a mage
who fled from a duel.

21:03.262 --> 21:04.805
[Dang-gu] But it's a ridiculous duel.

21:04.888 --> 21:06.723
And you didn't want it either.

21:06.807 --> 21:09.393
No one expects you to show up anyway, so.

21:09.476 --> 21:11.895
So you just stay here
and keep being laid-back

21:11.979 --> 21:13.355
like you always are.

21:14.356 --> 21:15.315
[sighs]

21:15.399 --> 21:16.942
[Seo Yul] The leader wanted me
to ask you something.

21:18.402 --> 21:20.487
He asked if you were doing
what you were told.

21:22.906 --> 21:23.740
[Jin] You are

21:24.241 --> 21:27.286
the child of an affair
had by your mother Do-hwa.

21:27.369 --> 21:29.913
But we cannot allow you
to lead Cheonbugwan after your father.

21:29.997 --> 21:33.166
So you can stop dreaming
because you'll never become anything…

21:36.545 --> 21:37.421
like your father.

21:38.088 --> 21:40.048
Continue to remain the Young Master…

21:41.508 --> 21:43.802
of the Jang family
who doesn't know anything.

21:47.597 --> 21:49.933
So, can I tell him
that you are doing what you were told?

21:50.017 --> 21:52.477
Have I ever listened
to what others have told me?

21:52.561 --> 21:54.604
I continue to live as I wish
and not listen to anyone,

21:54.688 --> 21:56.023
so please go tell him that.

21:58.942 --> 21:59.860
Dang-gu, give me the sword now.

22:00.902 --> 22:01.820
Why?

22:02.654 --> 22:04.948
Because I'll help Mu-deok
catch a pheasant.

22:09.369 --> 22:10.412
Safe travels.

22:16.043 --> 22:18.628
Did we just hurt Uk's pride
with what we said?

22:18.712 --> 22:19.588
[Seo Yul] Let him be.

22:20.172 --> 22:22.257
He can't return
just to meet a dignified death.

22:30.307 --> 22:32.476
As it turns out, you decided
to keep your father's sword.

22:35.187 --> 22:37.022
It hurts to hear
that everyone is mocking me.

22:38.982 --> 22:40.358
Well, now that your pride is hurt,

22:40.442 --> 22:42.527
we should train
like our lives depend on it.

22:43.403 --> 22:44.362
Are you happy to hear that?

22:45.572 --> 22:47.866
You seem glad to hear
that your pupil's become a joke.

22:48.825 --> 22:51.078
Shall I rub salt into the wound
now that you have been knocked down?

22:52.329 --> 22:55.624
Your friends didn't even ask you to return
to Songrim to face the Crown Prince.

22:55.707 --> 22:58.460
Although I'm sure they would have fought
to the death had they been in your shoes.

22:58.543 --> 23:01.463
[Mu-deok] They only told you
to hide and to run away from the reality.

23:02.547 --> 23:03.673
Can you guess why?

23:06.134 --> 23:08.804
That's because our Young Master
is worthless.

23:10.639 --> 23:12.599
My Master's tongue is as sharp as a knife.

23:13.433 --> 23:14.768
You stab and cut me.

23:15.393 --> 23:16.520
You're merciless.

23:16.603 --> 23:18.814
I'll continue to stab you
with knives all over,

23:18.897 --> 23:20.982
if it means getting my pupil
back on his feet.

23:21.066 --> 23:22.025
[Jang Uk] Yes, Master.

23:22.109 --> 23:24.361
Please continue stabbing
your worthless pupil while he's down.

23:27.072 --> 23:29.116
You're to draw your sword
when you have been spited.

23:29.199 --> 23:30.492
Why are you slinking off again?

23:32.994 --> 23:35.288
Your words were too spiteful.
It hurt me again.

23:36.039 --> 23:37.415
I need to bathe and cool myself down.

23:37.499 --> 23:39.292
[whimsical music playing]

23:39.376 --> 23:41.169
How can he bathe
so many times in a single day?

23:41.253 --> 23:42.754
You worthless, lazy scumbag.

23:42.838 --> 23:44.172
Just burn yourself in the hot water!

23:45.549 --> 23:48.760
Look at that. What kind of master
would wish for her pupil to burn himself?

23:48.844 --> 23:50.011
[clicks tongue]

23:52.722 --> 23:53.598
[huffs]

23:54.224 --> 23:57.102
Does Uk know
how he lost the Spirit Plaque?

23:57.185 --> 23:58.395
Does he remember anything specific?

23:58.979 --> 24:01.481
Oh, well, it is possible
someone picked it up and then sold it,

24:01.565 --> 24:03.733
which would then explain
why those men had it.

24:03.817 --> 24:05.861
I heard there's a place
that trades such Spirit Plaques.

24:07.237 --> 24:09.865
Then you two continue to track down
who sold his Spirit Plaque.

24:11.283 --> 24:12.409
- Sir.
- Sir.

24:12.492 --> 24:13.827
How is Uk?

24:16.121 --> 24:18.081
Is he doing well now?

24:20.041 --> 24:23.253
Uh, he fishes and drinks.
He appears to be doing well out there.

24:24.838 --> 24:26.464
He has not yet removed
the binding bracelet.

24:29.134 --> 24:30.468
You're dismissed.

24:41.354 --> 24:44.232
[rock-style action music playing]

24:51.156 --> 24:52.616
[Jang Uk] It's not that heavy anymore.

24:52.699 --> 24:54.326
It's not hindering my movements too.

24:54.409 --> 24:56.953
Some mages practice with an iron rod
in order to

24:57.037 --> 24:59.456
strengthen their arm muscles
for sword wielding.

24:59.539 --> 25:00.957
[Mu-deok] By wearing
that binding bracelet all day

25:01.041 --> 25:02.709
you're unknowingly training your arm.

25:02.792 --> 25:04.544
You're strengthening yourself
with its weight.

25:05.086 --> 25:06.504
Although it was not intentional,

25:06.588 --> 25:08.965
you found yourself
an excellent tool to help you train.

25:10.425 --> 25:11.801
You're very lucky indeed.

25:11.885 --> 25:15.180
If I take this off, then
I'll become faster and stronger.

25:15.764 --> 25:19.309
But if you fail to control it,
it will lash out with even more energy.

25:20.977 --> 25:21.895
Hey…

25:22.938 --> 25:24.272
Oh, never mind.

25:27.776 --> 25:30.695
So, what did you and… Yul talk about?

25:33.198 --> 25:34.616
We talked about Danhyanggok.

25:36.701 --> 25:39.621
He asked how the weather was
in the winter.

25:43.875 --> 25:45.669
You meant to tell me
that when you were young,

25:46.419 --> 25:48.088
you were good friends with Naksu?

25:50.048 --> 25:52.717
I was unsure before,
but going to Danhyanggok

25:53.426 --> 25:55.720
helps confirm
what I remembered about the past.

25:55.804 --> 25:56.888
That's why I'm here now.

25:56.972 --> 25:57.973
[Heo Yeom sucks teeth]

25:58.056 --> 26:01.768
Danhyanggok is known for being
a deep and dangerous valley.

26:01.851 --> 26:04.521
A young girl could not possibly
survive on her own.

26:05.105 --> 26:07.315
She seemed to be hiding
because had a problem.

26:08.858 --> 26:10.694
[Seo Yul]
After I told her about my family,

26:12.028 --> 26:13.446
I never saw her again.

26:14.990 --> 26:17.450
[Jin] That must mean
she recognized your family name.

26:18.243 --> 26:21.329
It is important that you tell me
everything you know about her.

26:24.291 --> 26:25.500
I know nothing.

26:26.209 --> 26:27.877
[Seo Yul]
I don't know her real name or age.

26:28.628 --> 26:30.422
Other than where we called the birds,

26:30.505 --> 26:32.173
I never got to see where she lived.

26:32.257 --> 26:33.341
[sighs]

26:36.469 --> 26:37.846
But one thing.

26:40.348 --> 26:42.017
She said something about her father.

26:42.934 --> 26:45.645
[harmonious music playing]

26:47.605 --> 26:48.982
[frogs croaking]

26:53.320 --> 26:56.906
My father used to record
the stars in the sky.

26:58.992 --> 27:00.827
[Seo Yul] I didn't pay attention to it
back then.

27:01.828 --> 27:03.955
But now that I think about it,
those who record stars

27:04.039 --> 27:05.623
are the mages of Cheonbugwan.

27:07.167 --> 27:08.126
My Lord.

27:08.626 --> 27:10.670
Among those constellation recorders,

27:12.005 --> 27:13.673
does anyone hold a grudge against us?

27:16.676 --> 27:17.969
Cheonbugwan's…

27:19.387 --> 27:20.472
recorder?

27:20.555 --> 27:22.891
[suspenseful music playing]

27:22.974 --> 27:24.184
Mage?

27:24.267 --> 27:25.393
[Chung shouting]

27:25.477 --> 27:27.062
[sword swishes]

27:28.730 --> 27:32.233
[Jin] Twenty years ago, there was
a constellation recorder mage

27:32.942 --> 27:35.570
who died at the hands
of the four great families.

27:37.447 --> 27:40.742
His entire family was killed that day.

27:41.493 --> 27:42.827
[Heo Yeom] Except for one.

27:42.911 --> 27:45.705
His only daughter disappeared.

27:50.710 --> 27:51.711
[gasps]

27:52.462 --> 27:54.547
[somber music playing]

28:12.357 --> 28:13.983
So the four families

28:14.943 --> 28:16.861
were involved in her father's death.

28:16.945 --> 28:19.155
Uh, she must have seen you as a child

28:19.239 --> 28:21.574
of her enemy and felt hostile towards you.

28:21.658 --> 28:24.577
Can you tell us anything else about her?

28:25.161 --> 28:26.830
This happened a long time ago.

28:27.872 --> 28:29.416
I don't remember anything else.

28:52.564 --> 28:54.065
[Seo Yul] I just wanted to see them.

28:55.567 --> 28:57.360
The broken leg didn't bother me,

28:57.861 --> 28:59.654
and I wasn't afraid of getting punished.

29:04.325 --> 29:05.910
I just like seeing them a lot.

29:05.994 --> 29:08.079
[melancholy music playing]

29:15.378 --> 29:17.005
[young Naksu] I've seen you out here,

29:17.088 --> 29:19.215
using that to call over your bird
a few times.

29:21.259 --> 29:22.844
I'd like to try it too.

29:23.428 --> 29:25.346
Let me… try it.

29:25.430 --> 29:27.724
[melancholy music continues playing]

30:01.257 --> 30:02.926
[water dropping, echoing]

30:05.762 --> 30:07.222
[suspenseful music playing]

30:10.892 --> 30:11.768
[water dripping]

30:21.402 --> 30:23.404
[Mu-deok] The Crown Prince is powerful.

30:23.488 --> 30:27.700
This is the only way my pupil
can subdue him and survive.

30:28.827 --> 30:30.203
Tansu, then.

30:31.621 --> 30:34.582
[action music playing]

31:04.237 --> 31:05.572
What do you want me to do?

31:07.782 --> 31:09.617
You will slice through
the falling drops of water.

31:11.035 --> 31:12.328
Although they are not raindrops,

31:12.412 --> 31:14.789
even someone as unskilled
at swordsmanship as you

31:14.873 --> 31:17.333
should be able to slice through
such slow-moving drops of water.

31:17.917 --> 31:18.918
Go on.

31:20.003 --> 31:22.005
[thrilling music playing]

31:22.630 --> 31:23.673
[exhales deeply]

31:30.680 --> 31:31.556
[soft splash]

31:33.349 --> 31:34.183
[soft splash]

31:36.394 --> 31:37.228
[chuckles]

31:39.147 --> 31:40.106
[sighs]

31:40.189 --> 31:42.066
You could only slice three drops
in one breath, huh?

31:42.984 --> 31:44.193
[Mu-deok] Well, it does not matter.

31:44.277 --> 31:47.739
Tansu, which you'll have to master soon,
will only require you to slice once.

31:47.822 --> 31:49.240
Tansu? But, um…

31:49.324 --> 31:51.659
[chuckles] Look here, Master.

31:52.160 --> 31:54.120
I understand that you want to teach me
as fast as possible

31:54.203 --> 31:55.663
because I'm a fast learner.

31:55.747 --> 31:57.582
But don't you think Tansu is pushing it?

31:57.665 --> 31:59.959
It appears you have learned something
from having so many masters.

32:00.043 --> 32:00.877
You're right.

32:00.960 --> 32:03.713
You need to have already mastered Chisu
before it's possible to learn Tansu.

32:04.631 --> 32:06.341
Tansu is not something

32:06.424 --> 32:09.135
you'll be able to learn
since you have barely mastered Ryusu,

32:09.218 --> 32:10.970
and are still struggling
to control your energy.

32:12.472 --> 32:13.473
Okay, but?

32:14.140 --> 32:15.350
It is the only way…

32:17.226 --> 32:19.729
my pupil can fight
against the Crown Prince

32:19.812 --> 32:21.356
and be able to walk away with his life.

32:24.943 --> 32:26.694
[pensive music playing]

32:34.494 --> 32:35.745
[beads clacking]

32:39.207 --> 32:41.250
[epic music playing]

32:45.713 --> 32:46.589
[gasps]

32:48.091 --> 32:49.175
[Jang Uk exclaims]

32:52.595 --> 32:54.681
[Jang Uk grunting]

32:55.848 --> 32:56.849
[Mu-deok] Tansu is a skill

32:56.933 --> 32:58.643
where you release energy
through your blade.

32:59.185 --> 33:00.812
Although your right arm lacks the skills,

33:01.688 --> 33:04.190
it has become much stronger
thanks to the bracelet.

33:05.233 --> 33:06.109
Just one drop.

33:07.694 --> 33:09.570
Hit one drop and emit your energy.

33:11.698 --> 33:13.199
- [Jang Uk shouts]
- [wood clacking]

33:13.282 --> 33:15.827
- [Jang Uk groans]
- [water dripping]

33:15.910 --> 33:18.746
[groans, breathes heavily]

33:22.709 --> 33:24.377
[Mu-deok]
You cannot master Tansu overnight.

33:24.961 --> 33:26.504
We shall resume after we eat.

33:33.052 --> 33:35.054
[Jang Uk groans]

33:36.931 --> 33:39.058
[harmonious music playing]

33:45.189 --> 33:47.275
- [sword swishing loudly]
- [Jang Uk exclaims]

34:09.047 --> 34:10.381
[Jang Uk groaning]

34:14.677 --> 34:15.678
Tansu, huh?

34:16.554 --> 34:18.347
What a ridiculous way to waste one's time.

34:21.309 --> 34:24.520
[Master Lee] So, those two
are not servant and Young Master.

34:25.104 --> 34:26.731
Instead, they are master and pupil.

34:38.493 --> 34:40.661
[thrilling music playing]

34:40.745 --> 34:42.080
[breathing heavily]

35:16.322 --> 35:19.325
[suspenseful music playing]

35:24.831 --> 35:26.040
[Jang Uk groans]

35:26.124 --> 35:27.500
[shudders]

35:59.448 --> 36:00.324
[sighs]

36:01.159 --> 36:02.285
[grunts]

36:02.785 --> 36:03.995
[Jang Uk groans in pain]

36:05.913 --> 36:07.081
Oh, Mu-deok.

36:09.417 --> 36:11.085
[Master Lee]
So, you have been training him.

36:14.547 --> 36:16.424
Training him to master the art of Tansu?

36:17.133 --> 36:18.342
Where did you learn such a skill?

36:18.926 --> 36:21.304
The Young Master Jang
is quite knowledgeable

36:21.387 --> 36:22.930
thanks to his 12 former masters.

36:23.014 --> 36:25.057
Is he trying to run
before even learning how to walk?

36:25.141 --> 36:27.268
He has a long way to go, and…

36:27.351 --> 36:29.604
[Mu-deok] In any case,
he should try to take a step.

36:29.687 --> 36:32.899
Then, if he takes that step,
your pupil could easily fall to his death.

36:36.903 --> 36:39.113
Is your Young Master even aware of that?

36:40.114 --> 36:42.366
[pensive music playing]

36:50.499 --> 36:51.500
[Jang Uk groans]

36:59.258 --> 37:01.969
[suspenseful music playing]

37:05.973 --> 37:07.350
[Jang Uk groaning]

37:14.649 --> 37:16.484
Why didn't you dodge it? [groans]

37:16.567 --> 37:17.652
[Jang Uk] You…

37:17.735 --> 37:19.987
[somber music playing]

37:33.668 --> 37:36.837
You're in pain because you're forcing
your energy to come out.

37:36.921 --> 37:39.382
[Master Lee] More importantly,
your arm could burst doing that.

37:43.052 --> 37:44.553
[Jang Uk grunts]

37:45.137 --> 37:48.474
There's a chance it could rot,
then you'll have to cut your arm off.

37:49.225 --> 37:50.059
You mean it?

37:54.438 --> 37:56.565
[Master Lee] If rotten energy surges
throughout your body,

37:56.649 --> 37:57.525
it'll be much worse.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.402
You could die.

38:07.994 --> 38:10.037
[somber music continues playing]

38:19.130 --> 38:21.382
The heat in your arm is gone.
You are fine now.

38:21.465 --> 38:23.217
So, all you need is rest.

38:24.051 --> 38:24.885
Don't lie to me, okay?

38:27.054 --> 38:28.848
Everything Master Lee said
was true, right?

38:29.390 --> 38:31.225
But then again, whether I die of poison,

38:31.309 --> 38:34.729
or I'm flogged to death, or I'm stabbed,
or my arm explodes into pieces,

38:34.812 --> 38:38.190
my merciless master will never worry
about her pupil, right?

38:40.026 --> 38:41.193
Right, I'm not worried.

38:42.194 --> 38:44.113
Because you have so much luck, don't you?

38:44.697 --> 38:46.115
And you're also competent.

38:46.949 --> 38:49.201
Wow, look at that.
You really are an excellent liar too.

38:52.538 --> 38:54.457
I'm only trying not to dampen your spirit.

38:55.041 --> 38:58.210
Ah, thank you so much,
my very cruel yet caring master.

38:58.294 --> 39:00.713
But you should never come close to me
when I'm holding a sword.

39:00.796 --> 39:02.548
You almost got stabbed back there.

39:03.132 --> 39:05.468
I only stood there because I was waiting
for you to control your energy

39:05.551 --> 39:06.635
before it was too late.

39:06.719 --> 39:07.928
I was trying not to interfere.

39:08.012 --> 39:10.765
Don't do that.
I'm just worried about you so much.

39:13.684 --> 39:15.561
[soft music playing]

39:17.563 --> 39:19.440
Consider it like the warm feelings
of a mother bird

39:19.523 --> 39:21.567
who is worried about her egg cracking.
You know that?

39:21.650 --> 39:22.985
Stop it!
[clears throat]

39:23.069 --> 39:24.445
It will take more than that.

39:24.528 --> 39:25.404
I could have dodged it.

39:26.405 --> 39:27.365
Why didn't you?

39:27.448 --> 39:29.658
I was really fast back there.
How could you have dodged it?

39:29.742 --> 39:31.577
You are not as fast as you think.

39:32.078 --> 39:34.246
- You're such a…
- Ow!

39:35.289 --> 39:37.083
See how fast I am?
You couldn't dodge that at all!

39:37.166 --> 39:38.459
Because you just did it without warning!

39:38.542 --> 39:40.378
Really? Then this time,
I'll warn you in advance.

39:40.461 --> 39:41.462
Mu-deok, your eyes.

39:41.962 --> 39:43.297
Ah! You--

39:44.256 --> 39:45.132
You bastard.

39:45.216 --> 39:47.051
I cannot believe
that you still fell for that.

39:47.134 --> 39:47.968
[chuckles]

39:52.181 --> 39:53.432
Why don't you try that again now?

39:54.642 --> 39:55.935
Try again from this close?

39:56.018 --> 39:57.603
- Really?
- Try me.

40:02.566 --> 40:03.442
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

40:04.860 --> 40:06.862
The blue mark in your eye
is barely visible.

40:07.905 --> 40:09.073
It was very pretty.

40:12.952 --> 40:14.120
And you should not say things like

40:14.203 --> 40:16.539
"Try me" when you're standing this close
to another person.

40:17.373 --> 40:18.499
If you say "Try me" like this,

40:18.582 --> 40:20.000
do you really think I'd poke your eyes?

40:20.084 --> 40:22.253
[tense music playing]

40:23.045 --> 40:24.338
[Jang Uk chuckles]

40:24.422 --> 40:26.549
I see you're not a fool after all,
my Master.

40:26.632 --> 40:29.260
But when it comes to this kind of thing,
should I be your master?

40:31.011 --> 40:33.889
[whimsical jazz music playing]

40:33.973 --> 40:34.890
Jang Uk.

40:38.477 --> 40:41.856
You must think that because I lived alone
in a place like this, I'm very naïve.

40:43.441 --> 40:44.567
Well, yeah?

40:46.527 --> 40:49.530
I have so much to teach you,
lots of things.

40:50.322 --> 40:51.866
[hesitates] Like what?

40:56.912 --> 40:57.913
Ow!

40:58.998 --> 41:00.291
Hey, Mu-deok!

41:00.374 --> 41:02.209
"Surely, she would not poke me like this?"

41:02.710 --> 41:05.838
A truly skilled individual strikes when
their adversary is thinking like that.

41:06.464 --> 41:08.132
Remember that, my naïve pupil.

41:09.508 --> 41:10.718
Hey, you poked me really hard!

41:10.801 --> 41:13.637
I can't see. I'm injured.
I poked you only lightly. It's unfair!

41:13.721 --> 41:15.181
Mu-deok.
[groans in pain]

41:17.683 --> 41:18.517
Hey, Mu-deok.

41:28.736 --> 41:30.529
[Go Won] Is that another new concubine?

41:31.363 --> 41:33.240
So he has this attitude to ignore law
and procedure,

41:33.324 --> 41:34.617
and is getting married in secret.

41:34.700 --> 41:37.495
[eunuch] She comes from a small family
of mages in the east.

41:37.578 --> 41:40.831
On the day she was born, a comet
had brushed past the Big Dipper.

41:40.915 --> 41:42.917
At this rate, he will summon
all of the women in Daeho

41:43.000 --> 41:44.543
who were born under all sorts of stars.

41:44.627 --> 41:47.171
[Jin Mu] That is because your father's
after the King's Star.

41:49.173 --> 41:51.467
[eerie music playing]

41:58.349 --> 42:00.100
When the late king ascended the throne,

42:00.184 --> 42:02.853
a prophecy was made about
how the next great king would be born

42:02.937 --> 42:04.396
with the energy of the King's Star.

42:05.105 --> 42:07.358
The people of Daeho were delighted.

42:08.359 --> 42:09.235
However,

42:09.318 --> 42:12.696
your father, who ascended the throne,
had an ordinary horoscope,

42:12.780 --> 42:14.323
and you had the same.

42:15.115 --> 42:16.659
There were many rumors.

42:17.785 --> 42:19.370
The prophecy was incorrect from the start.

42:19.453 --> 42:23.165
And Gwanju Jang Gang fled because he gave
such a ridiculous prediction.

42:23.249 --> 42:25.793
But His Majesty believes that prophecy.

42:25.876 --> 42:27.795
That is why he is afraid, sire.

42:30.089 --> 42:31.632
I am not afraid of him.

42:31.715 --> 42:34.677
But you are afraid that someone
born under the King's Star will appear,

42:34.760 --> 42:36.679
that a child like this will be born.

42:37.555 --> 42:39.640
[Jin Mu] Does this not make you afraid?

42:43.060 --> 42:45.563
Your duel against Jang Uk
is right around the corner.

42:45.646 --> 42:48.983
Eliminate the son of the man
who gave such a terrifying prophecy.

42:50.609 --> 42:53.404
You must get rid of that what you fear
when you are able to.

42:56.031 --> 42:57.116
Do you…

42:58.158 --> 42:59.618
think Jang Uk would even show up?

43:00.619 --> 43:01.620
I heard he fled immediately.

43:02.621 --> 43:06.000
Rumor has it that he is even
contemplating marriage to avoid it.

43:07.334 --> 43:08.460
Jang Uk is getting married?

43:08.544 --> 43:10.671
I heard that he is marrying
into the Jin family

43:10.754 --> 43:12.464
in order to gain
the protection of their plaque.

43:18.887 --> 43:20.889
Wait, Uk and Cho-yeon are getting married?

43:21.765 --> 43:23.392
Didn't they break it off last time?

43:24.435 --> 43:26.687
That is why the preparation
is no trouble at all.

43:27.271 --> 43:30.399
Young Lady Jin still has
the marriage gifts

43:30.482 --> 43:32.651
from their previous engagement party.

43:33.986 --> 43:34.903
Oh.

43:35.863 --> 43:36.780
Right.

43:37.364 --> 43:39.742
[Cho-yeon]
After the marriage ceremony, Jang Uk,

43:40.242 --> 43:43.078
I mean, my husband
will have to move into our home.

43:43.704 --> 43:46.206
But my current room
is too small for the both of us.

43:46.790 --> 43:49.877
Could we possibly use the big room
on the east side of the house,

43:49.960 --> 43:50.836
instead of my room?

43:51.420 --> 43:54.048
You know it's your sister's, Bu-yeon's.

43:55.841 --> 43:58.135
But it's the best room
we have in our house.

43:58.218 --> 44:01.263
Leaving it vacant for over a decade
is a waste, if you ask me.

44:02.431 --> 44:03.724
It's never been vacant.

44:04.433 --> 44:06.143
Its owner will return.
So how is it vacant?

44:07.561 --> 44:09.313
I'm sorry for what I said, Mother.

44:12.232 --> 44:13.859
Your Father is looking for her.

44:15.194 --> 44:18.197
He'll make sure
that Bu-yeon returns home soon.

44:20.783 --> 44:22.993
You may go and bring the yin-yang jade.

44:24.578 --> 44:25.579
[gasps]

44:25.663 --> 44:26.705
Why the yin-yang jade?

44:26.789 --> 44:28.207
Have you not been begging for it?

44:29.792 --> 44:31.502
They say that when a couple shares rings

44:31.585 --> 44:34.546
made with this jade,
your love for each other deepens.

44:36.840 --> 44:39.677
You may have it
to craft your wedding rings with it.

44:41.261 --> 44:42.846
Thank you so much, Mother.

44:42.930 --> 44:45.432
[soft music playing]

44:57.820 --> 44:59.446
- [Cho-yeon gasps]
- [box clatters]

45:00.155 --> 45:01.115
[groans]

45:03.409 --> 45:04.660
[gasps]

45:04.743 --> 45:06.286
[eerie laughter]

45:06.370 --> 45:09.164
You stupid pot.
It was you, right?

45:09.248 --> 45:10.791
Ugh, so annoying.

45:15.921 --> 45:16.922
[sighs]

45:18.006 --> 45:19.007
So,

45:19.091 --> 45:21.176
I suppose it annoys you
that I'm getting married.

45:21.260 --> 45:22.344
But just you wait.

45:22.428 --> 45:25.806
I'll wear this yin-yang jade as a ring,
and I'll be even more annoying.

45:26.390 --> 45:27.307
Hmm!

45:30.769 --> 45:33.605
[ominous music playing]

45:33.689 --> 45:34.565
[scoffs softly]

45:38.610 --> 45:39.695
Eat up, you two.

45:40.946 --> 45:41.822
Yeah.

45:44.366 --> 45:46.452
[Master Lee]
I brought home a pheasant earlier.

45:46.952 --> 45:49.246
Where did the pheasant go
and why do I only see greens?

45:49.329 --> 45:50.414
The pheasant meat is in the--

45:51.248 --> 45:52.583
It's in the soup.

45:52.666 --> 45:53.834
The pheasant was not very big,

45:53.917 --> 45:55.669
so there wasn't much left
after I made the broth.

45:56.712 --> 45:59.006
[whimsical music playing]

45:59.089 --> 46:00.132
[Jang Uk gasps]

46:04.970 --> 46:05.846
Mm.

46:06.680 --> 46:08.682
There's a very faint taste of pheasant.

46:13.687 --> 46:16.482
I overheard this
while selling herbs in Songrim.

46:16.565 --> 46:18.942
Two prominent families
are marrying off their children.

46:19.526 --> 46:21.445
Marriage? Who are they?

46:21.528 --> 46:24.448
They say Lady Jin's daughter is marrying
the son of a powerful family.

46:25.157 --> 46:27.075
Jin Cho-yeon, huh?
Is she getting married?

46:27.159 --> 46:28.202
Who's the groom?

46:28.285 --> 46:30.412
Apparently it's the son
of the Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

46:32.706 --> 46:34.082
Aren't you the son of the Gwanju?

46:35.250 --> 46:36.502
[muffled cough]

46:37.085 --> 46:38.295
[coughing]

46:38.378 --> 46:40.714
[whimsical music playing]

46:45.052 --> 46:47.346
[Jang Uk] I mean, how can I get married
without knowing about it?

46:47.429 --> 46:49.973
[Jang Uk] What on earth is going on?
What is Maid Kim up to now?

46:50.057 --> 46:51.892
Well, most hastened weddings
tend to have been

46:51.975 --> 46:53.519
- because the bride is pregnant.
- Impossible.

46:54.520 --> 46:56.146
Weren't you two previously engaged?

46:56.772 --> 46:58.357
Could it be
that you couldn't control yourself?

46:58.440 --> 47:00.526
I've never even stayed this close
to Cho-yeon.

47:00.609 --> 47:01.652
How could she be pregnant, huh?

47:02.736 --> 47:04.613
Okay. You're all talk, after all.

47:04.696 --> 47:05.864
Huh?

47:05.948 --> 47:07.824
Then why didn't you drink
Master Lee's chaste tea?

47:07.908 --> 47:08.909
Because one day I will--

47:11.495 --> 47:12.996
Because one day I'll get married.

47:13.580 --> 47:14.748
[scoffs]

47:14.831 --> 47:16.583
So, you do want to marry someone.

47:17.209 --> 47:19.419
[sighs]
Uh, I do want to get married.

47:19.503 --> 47:20.629
I wanna marry someone.

47:21.547 --> 47:24.174
[Jang Uk] I am definitely going
to get married someday, okay?

47:24.258 --> 47:25.259
Hey, wait up.

47:39.147 --> 47:40.107
[Dang-gu clears throat]

47:40.649 --> 47:42.192
[Dang-gu] Why did you want to see me?

47:42.985 --> 47:44.987
I ordered a mother-of-pearl cabinet.

47:45.070 --> 47:46.405
Do you know when it will get here?

47:47.030 --> 47:48.282
I plan to put it in our bedroom.

47:48.365 --> 47:52.369
I believe the traders from the south
will arrive here in about two weeks.

47:53.120 --> 47:54.371
But that's too late.

47:55.414 --> 47:56.873
I should have ordered it sooner.

47:56.957 --> 47:58.500
Don't you think…

47:59.376 --> 48:01.295
you should inform the groom
before you buy furniture?

48:02.629 --> 48:04.548
He has no idea
you two are getting married.

48:04.631 --> 48:05.549
[chuckles softly]

48:06.550 --> 48:08.677
[Cho-yeon] That's why I've already written
a letter to him.

48:09.636 --> 48:10.929
Could you take a look
and tell me what you think?

48:12.723 --> 48:13.765
Oh, okay.

48:13.849 --> 48:15.934
[soft piano music playing]

48:16.018 --> 48:16.893
[sniffs]

48:17.644 --> 48:18.604
It smells so good.

48:18.687 --> 48:20.981
It's a perfume that incurs
the feelings of love.

48:21.898 --> 48:23.358
One of the treasures of Jinyowon.

48:23.442 --> 48:25.277
[sniffing]

48:25.360 --> 48:27.571
Wow, it is a really lovely scent.

48:29.906 --> 48:33.577
[romantic music playing]

48:49.551 --> 48:52.346
Why are you sniffing it,
Young Master Park? Stop right now!

48:53.472 --> 48:55.390
Hold your nose. Your nose!

49:07.736 --> 49:09.571
I almost wasted the precious perfume.

49:12.783 --> 49:14.493
Please pass my letter on to Jang Uk.

49:15.077 --> 49:18.288
And make sure there are no other women
around him when he opens it.

49:21.166 --> 49:22.501
Okay.

49:23.168 --> 49:24.795
- Huh?
- [Dang-gu gasps]

49:25.879 --> 49:27.172
[laughs softly]

49:27.255 --> 49:28.382
Cho-yeon, what are you doing?

49:28.465 --> 49:30.050
Your hands are as the same size as Uk's.

49:30.550 --> 49:33.136
They look the same, right,
Young Master Park?

49:35.222 --> 49:36.098
Why?

49:37.224 --> 49:39.643
Come with me
to get our wedding rings fitted.

49:39.726 --> 49:41.061
Would you do that for me?

49:41.895 --> 49:43.855
Why should I go
get your wedding rings fitted?

49:44.356 --> 49:45.524
You should go with your groom.

49:46.650 --> 49:49.653
Marriage is not something one does
because only one person wants it.

49:49.736 --> 49:51.238
Both sides have to want it.

49:51.321 --> 49:54.074
It's just really hard to see you
like this, doing all this alone.

49:55.450 --> 49:56.785
Why?

49:57.786 --> 49:59.663
Do you think I am getting ahead of myself?

50:00.539 --> 50:02.499
And that Uk would break if off again
like last time?

50:04.584 --> 50:06.837
[melancholy music playing]

50:07.462 --> 50:10.173
Whether or not
you're getting ahead of yourself,

50:11.717 --> 50:15.137
I'll help you with the wedding rings.
Just make sure the wedding goes well.

50:20.183 --> 50:21.935
I will lend you my hand.

50:31.194 --> 50:32.696
[Jang Uk] I have been thinking about it.

50:32.779 --> 50:35.240
And Maid Kim was vehemently
against the idea of me moving

50:35.323 --> 50:37.576
into Cho-yeon's house
when we last discussed marriage.

50:39.035 --> 50:42.247
There can only be one reason for it,
if she'd allow it now.

50:42.748 --> 50:43.957
It is to save me.

50:44.541 --> 50:46.793
She must have made
a deal with the Jin family

50:46.877 --> 50:49.212
to avoid your duel with the Crown Prince
by marrying Cho-yeon.

50:49.296 --> 50:51.256
That must mean she needed Lady Jin's help.

50:52.841 --> 50:54.384
Then, if that truly is the case,

50:55.594 --> 50:56.845
will you get married?

50:58.597 --> 51:01.600
What do you think, Master?
Should I marry her?

51:03.977 --> 51:05.103
Can I?

51:07.189 --> 51:10.650
I will not be able to stay here with you
if you get married.

51:11.234 --> 51:13.320
[Jang Uk] You're right.
I should return home.

51:13.403 --> 51:15.447
Even if you do return home,
we cannot be as we are now.

51:15.530 --> 51:18.408
Why? You can still be by my side
as my servant.

51:20.786 --> 51:23.288
I do not intend to stay by your side
only as your servant.

51:41.515 --> 51:43.141
You should go and check it out yourself.

51:43.225 --> 51:44.726
I will be waiting for you at Chwiseonru.

51:46.228 --> 51:49.147
If you don't pick me up,
I will go back on my own.

51:58.615 --> 51:59.616
[sighs]

52:03.870 --> 52:05.622
CHWISEONRU

52:08.416 --> 52:10.377
[tense music playing]

52:11.253 --> 52:12.087
What?

52:12.170 --> 52:13.839
We are mages from Cheonbugwan.

52:13.922 --> 52:15.799
We have orders to bring you in
if we spotted you.

52:15.882 --> 52:16.716
Let's go.

52:20.053 --> 52:22.556
[Mu-deok] The Crown Prince
personally gave me his sachet.

52:22.639 --> 52:25.684
Meaning I have his protection.
You're not allowed to take me anywhere.

52:29.020 --> 52:31.481
[gasps]
What are you doing? Let me go!

52:31.565 --> 52:33.400
I have the Crown Prince's assertion.

52:33.483 --> 52:34.609
[grunts]

52:45.620 --> 52:47.664
We brought her
from Chwiseonru as instructed.

52:48.290 --> 52:49.791
Chwiseonru?

52:52.669 --> 52:54.004
[court lady groans]

52:58.967 --> 53:01.303
The girl you requested is here,
Your Highness.

53:01.928 --> 53:02.762
Where?

53:06.683 --> 53:07.851
[court lady] She is right here.

53:10.687 --> 53:11.605
[Go Won] Her?

53:11.688 --> 53:13.440
[court lady] You should
raise your head, girl.

53:14.232 --> 53:18.069
[harmonious music playing]

53:28.413 --> 53:31.249
Huh? Hey, why are you dressed like that?

53:31.833 --> 53:33.335
I have no idea.

53:34.210 --> 53:37.088
Your maid just dragged me here,
and she made me look like this.

53:38.048 --> 53:40.216
- What? Is this your doing?
- [court lady] Is--

53:40.300 --> 53:42.385
Is she not the gisaeng
brought over from Chwiseonru…

53:43.345 --> 53:44.512
Crown Prince?

53:44.596 --> 53:45.639
[sighs]

53:45.722 --> 53:46.932
She's not.

53:48.475 --> 53:50.810
- She's just Filthy Mu-deok.
- Who?

53:52.896 --> 53:54.022
[scoffs]
Go on.

53:55.148 --> 53:56.316
Go now.

53:59.611 --> 54:00.445
What is this?

54:04.991 --> 54:06.910
Why did you ask them to bring me here?

54:06.993 --> 54:09.621
I had something filthy
to tell Filthy Mu-deok,

54:09.704 --> 54:10.830
so I told them to get you.

54:10.914 --> 54:12.916
[Go Won]
But you are not filthy right now, are you?

54:12.999 --> 54:14.626
Filth and silk don't go hand in hand.

54:15.335 --> 54:17.921
It seems they do for someone
such as you, Your Royal Highness.

54:19.130 --> 54:20.340
Did you actually just snap at me?

54:20.924 --> 54:21.967
Never.

54:22.050 --> 54:25.011
I'm grateful that you dressed someone
like myself in silk.

54:26.721 --> 54:29.891
Okay, so, this, uh…

54:31.768 --> 54:33.144
this does not suit you.

54:36.022 --> 54:39.401
Since you don't want to see me like this,
and I'm uncomfortable right now,

54:39.484 --> 54:40.735
I'll go get changed.

54:40.819 --> 54:41.903
Wait.

54:43.071 --> 54:45.657
Uh, it's fine. Just keep it on.

54:48.868 --> 54:52.205
Tell me then, what you wish from me.
Whatever it is, I'll do it.

54:52.288 --> 54:54.582
Just go and tell your master
to not show up.

54:55.291 --> 54:56.501
To not be here at our duel.

54:57.752 --> 55:01.506
[Go Won] I would rather spare his life
than make enemies of Songrim.

55:02.966 --> 55:05.260
It's best for everyone to say
that Jang Uk fled the duel.

55:06.803 --> 55:09.431
So Jang Uk just needs
to be the laughingstock of Daeho.

55:09.931 --> 55:10.765
[Go Won] That's right.

55:11.599 --> 55:14.894
If he insists on coming to the duel,
you have to stop him.

55:14.978 --> 55:16.896
If he comes to the duel, I will kill him.

55:19.482 --> 55:22.610
So, tell him to stay hidden
and marry into the Jin family.

55:23.987 --> 55:26.990
So, it is true that if he gets married,
he won't have to fight.

55:29.826 --> 55:32.287
What will you do
when your Young Master gets married?

55:32.370 --> 55:33.246
Will you follow him?

55:33.913 --> 55:35.206
No, I won't.

55:35.832 --> 55:38.501
Why? Did he say
he will not bring you with him?

55:40.503 --> 55:44.049
So he's leaving behind a servant
who would drink filthy water for him.

55:44.132 --> 55:45.550
Jang Uk knows neither loyalty

55:46.134 --> 55:47.010
nor his duty.

55:48.344 --> 55:52.390
He does know a little bit of…
loyalty and duty.

55:52.474 --> 55:54.893
You're on his side?
You always bad-mouthed him.

55:54.976 --> 55:56.770
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

55:58.063 --> 56:00.023
I know me bad-mouthing him
would please you.

56:00.940 --> 56:04.194
But I do not have any energy needed
to run my mouth off right now.

56:04.694 --> 56:06.237
[chuckles softly]

56:06.321 --> 56:08.782
You've become a filthy mutt
who's destined to be abandoned, huh?

56:20.293 --> 56:21.169
Should I take you in?

56:23.379 --> 56:24.547
I can if you want.

56:25.131 --> 56:27.425
I'm sure there will be things
for you to do in the palace.

56:28.843 --> 56:30.220
No, Sir.

56:31.054 --> 56:33.723
Although I may be a filthy girl
avoided by everyone,

56:34.599 --> 56:37.143
I refuse to serve just anyone,
Your Royal Highness.

56:40.814 --> 56:41.731
Forget it.

56:42.482 --> 56:45.151
I do not want filth by my side.
You may leave.

56:45.235 --> 56:46.111
Yes.

56:51.825 --> 56:53.201
I will leave you be,

56:53.785 --> 56:54.953
Your Royal Highness.

57:05.088 --> 57:05.964
"Just anyone?"

57:07.549 --> 57:08.591
I'm the Crown Prince.

57:09.175 --> 57:10.677
That filthy girl.

57:10.760 --> 57:12.303
She just says whatever she wants.

57:18.268 --> 57:21.396
[ominous music playing]

57:30.029 --> 57:32.532
- Careful now. You can take your time.
- [servant] Thanks.

57:35.076 --> 57:36.077
Maid Kim.

57:36.911 --> 57:38.538
- How have you been, huh?
- [exclaims happily]

57:39.122 --> 57:42.584
Young Master!
Oh gosh, my dear Young Master!

57:42.667 --> 57:44.169
[maid Kim] Oh wow.
[sobs]

57:44.669 --> 57:46.129
- Oh, Young Master!
- Were you worried?

57:46.212 --> 57:48.089
Please tell me, have you been eating well?

57:48.173 --> 57:50.675
- Mm. I have. I have been eating well.
- Oh, my.

57:50.758 --> 57:53.470
- Wow, Maid Kim, your skin is radiating.
- Oh!

57:53.553 --> 57:56.222
Let's go inside.
[laughs]

57:58.766 --> 58:00.935
[Seo Yul] The one who tried
to sell Songrim's Spirit Plaque,

58:03.104 --> 58:04.147
was it that woman?

58:04.230 --> 58:06.900
[tense music playing]

58:12.572 --> 58:14.407
It was not me. It was Mu-deok's idea.

58:15.450 --> 58:17.410
So Mu-deok tried
to sell Uk's Spirit Plaque?

58:17.494 --> 58:19.746
I was only trying
to introduce her to the seller.

58:19.829 --> 58:21.831
But Ae-hyang stole it
and tried to sell it herself.

58:21.915 --> 58:23.875
So, really, Mu-deok and I had nothing
to do with it.

58:41.601 --> 58:42.769
What is this?

58:44.437 --> 58:46.523
Why are you here and dressed up like that?

58:47.524 --> 58:48.983
It is a really long story.

58:49.067 --> 58:51.819
Don't tell me…
you've returned to Chwiseonru?

58:52.987 --> 58:54.948
Did Uk send you back
because he is getting married?

58:55.031 --> 58:56.324
God, no.

58:56.407 --> 58:58.535
Even if Young Master Jang
does get married,

58:58.618 --> 59:00.328
there is no way
I would ever come back here.

59:00.411 --> 59:02.413
Ju-wol finally caved and confessed.

59:02.497 --> 59:04.207
You tried to sell Uk's Spirit Plaque.

59:07.627 --> 59:09.379
Yeah, I did try.

59:10.421 --> 59:11.756
Why?

59:12.382 --> 59:14.050
Well, because I wanted to make money.

59:14.133 --> 59:16.844
[Mu-deok] I wanted to wear pretty clothes
like this, eat good food,

59:16.928 --> 59:19.430
and be able to afford having fun
at places like this.

59:19.514 --> 59:23.017
So when you were drunk before,
you were trying to have fun like this?

59:24.102 --> 59:27.188
That's right. I stole Young Master Jang's
money and drank it away.

59:28.815 --> 59:29.816
[scoffs]

59:31.859 --> 59:33.820
It's impossible for me to understand you.

59:35.530 --> 59:38.116
I truly will never know
what's going on in that head of yours.

59:41.703 --> 59:43.913
Why would you need to do that,
Young Master Seo Yul?

59:43.997 --> 59:45.623
It's best for you to remain ignorant.

59:48.209 --> 59:49.335
I will be going inside now.

59:49.419 --> 59:51.087
Would you like to come in with me,
Young Master?

59:52.046 --> 59:53.381
No, thanks.

59:54.215 --> 59:55.174
Bye then.

59:55.258 --> 59:57.844
[tense music playing]

01:00:00.847 --> 01:00:04.475
CHWISEONRU

01:00:08.605 --> 01:00:09.814
The Plaque…

01:00:11.274 --> 01:00:13.109
So Naksu was the one selling it.

01:00:13.192 --> 01:00:14.402
I'll find you.

01:00:14.485 --> 01:00:15.486
[tense music intensifies]

01:00:24.579 --> 01:00:25.622
Young Master.

01:00:27.582 --> 01:00:29.417
Why do you not want
to marry into their family?

01:00:31.419 --> 01:00:32.795
Do you dislike Young Lady Jin?

01:00:32.879 --> 01:00:35.214
It is not that I dislike her. I'm…

01:00:36.424 --> 01:00:38.134
I'm just not interested in her.

01:00:38.760 --> 01:00:40.887
You have feelings
for another young lady then, don't you?

01:00:42.347 --> 01:00:43.473
[maid Kim] What's her name?

01:00:44.057 --> 01:00:45.558
Is it someone I've met before?

01:00:46.559 --> 01:00:48.603
No, you have never met her before,
Maidservant Kim.

01:00:49.187 --> 01:00:50.396
So there is one.

01:00:50.480 --> 01:00:51.731
Tell me everything.

01:00:51.814 --> 01:00:52.857
I knew there was a girl.

01:00:54.567 --> 01:00:55.443
Well…

01:00:55.526 --> 01:00:58.446
she-- she is like a single bird egg
at the top of a tall tree.

01:00:59.155 --> 01:01:02.617
I'm the only one she has.
How can I possibly go off and get married?

01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:05.203
You just described
the most dangerous kind of woman!

01:01:05.703 --> 01:01:07.955
The kind who have nothing
and claim you're all they have.

01:01:08.039 --> 01:01:09.540
[sighs]
She's not like that.

01:01:10.208 --> 01:01:13.461
Who is she? Tell me this instant, hmm?
I will take care of it right away.

01:01:13.544 --> 01:01:14.712
And how would you do that?

01:01:14.796 --> 01:01:17.256
Once I give her a silk pouch
with more money than she can count,

01:01:17.340 --> 01:01:19.926
her egg will crack
and she'll soar away fine!

01:01:20.009 --> 01:01:22.387
[sighs]
I'm telling you, she can't just soar away.

01:01:22.470 --> 01:01:24.639
- Things aren't that simple. Jeez.
- Hmm.

01:01:24.722 --> 01:01:27.016
In any case,
I can't get married right now, okay?

01:01:27.100 --> 01:01:28.142
So take care of it for me.

01:01:28.226 --> 01:01:31.270
- Huh?
- You heard me. Do it.

01:01:32.063 --> 01:01:33.398
Young Master.

01:01:33.481 --> 01:01:34.357
[yelps]

01:01:36.067 --> 01:01:38.611
What's wrong with your arm?
Did you get hurt?

01:01:38.695 --> 01:01:39.737
Show me.

01:01:41.531 --> 01:01:44.033
[maid Kim gasps]
What did you do to your arm?

01:01:45.993 --> 01:01:47.495
Did it get out of control again?

01:01:54.961 --> 01:01:56.337
Please sell this for me.

01:01:56.421 --> 01:01:59.424
It's made of the finest silk,
so make sure to sell it for lots of money.

01:01:59.507 --> 01:02:03.261
All right. Oh, the madam is tending
to a customer at the moment.

01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:04.887
Young Lady Jin from Jinyowon is with her.

01:02:05.805 --> 01:02:07.849
[gisaeng] She is looking for someone
who can craft her wedding rings

01:02:07.932 --> 01:02:09.183
for the big day.

01:02:09.267 --> 01:02:11.102
It seems she is marrying
a young master from Songrim.

01:02:11.185 --> 01:02:12.520
[gisaeng chuckles]

01:02:15.565 --> 01:02:17.275
[Ju-wol] How do you feel about this one?

01:02:17.358 --> 01:02:18.943
[instrumental music playing]

01:02:20.319 --> 01:02:24.031
So these are the works
of the finest craftsmen in all of Daeho?

01:02:26.075 --> 01:02:28.703
They are fancy, but a bit too tacky.

01:02:28.786 --> 01:02:29.787
Hmm.

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:32.749
Then before we continue,
may I see the yin-yang jade?

01:02:32.832 --> 01:02:35.334
Seeing it for myself will help me
give you better recommendations.

01:02:36.461 --> 01:02:37.378
Hmm.

01:02:40.339 --> 01:02:42.675
They say when a man and woman
share a yin-and-yang jade,

01:02:42.759 --> 01:02:44.761
their love for each other
only grows deeper.

01:02:46.679 --> 01:02:49.015
[ominous music playing]

01:02:57.064 --> 01:02:58.065
[Cho-yeon sighs]

01:02:59.066 --> 01:03:00.401
[Cho-yeon] Why did the jade break?

01:03:01.360 --> 01:03:03.237
It was fine when I left Jinyowon.

01:03:06.616 --> 01:03:08.618
- [Cho-yeon yelps]
- [box clatters]

01:03:09.202 --> 01:03:12.288
[sighs]
So it broke when I fell.

01:03:13.289 --> 01:03:14.290
[sighs]

01:03:15.666 --> 01:03:16.501
[gisaeng] Mu-deok.

01:03:23.257 --> 01:03:24.425
[Ju-wol] Young Lady Jin.

01:03:25.009 --> 01:03:27.303
You're leaving Chwiseonru so soon. Why?

01:03:27.386 --> 01:03:30.473
I see that Mu-deok is here.
So, is Uk here as well?

01:03:31.140 --> 01:03:32.350
No.

01:03:32.433 --> 01:03:33.935
Oh. Okay.

01:03:34.018 --> 01:03:35.561
He and Mu-deok are attached at the hip,

01:03:35.645 --> 01:03:37.605
so he's probably in the fortress.
Maybe you can look for him there.

01:03:37.688 --> 01:03:39.649
They're attached at the hip?

01:03:39.732 --> 01:03:41.275
She serves him only as his servant.

01:03:42.401 --> 01:03:43.820
Watch what you say.

01:03:45.279 --> 01:03:47.990
You should know that Mu-deok
is not just any ordinary servant

01:03:48.074 --> 01:03:49.575
to Young Master Jang.

01:03:50.284 --> 01:03:53.496
One time Mu-deok got really drunk here,
and he came to take her home.

01:03:54.247 --> 01:03:55.957
[Ju-wol] They have a real connection.

01:03:56.040 --> 01:03:58.543
The Young Master even carried her home
on his back.

01:03:59.293 --> 01:04:00.127
You know,

01:04:00.211 --> 01:04:02.046
he must have bought her from us

01:04:02.129 --> 01:04:03.923
because she has a special place
in his heart.

01:04:04.465 --> 01:04:06.509
He bought Mu-deok from Chwiseonru?

01:04:06.592 --> 01:04:07.760
She was a gisaeng?

01:04:07.844 --> 01:04:09.470
She was one really poor girl.

01:04:09.971 --> 01:04:13.266
It's no wonder the Young Master
cares about Mu-deok so much.

01:04:18.479 --> 01:04:19.730
[sighs]

01:04:26.070 --> 01:04:26.904
[Cho-yeon] Hmm!

01:04:27.780 --> 01:04:28.656
You.

01:04:29.282 --> 01:04:31.075
You know who I am, right, Mu-deok?

01:04:32.535 --> 01:04:34.579
Oh, of course.

01:04:34.662 --> 01:04:37.123
You are Jin Cho-yeon from Jinyowon, right?

01:04:39.208 --> 01:04:42.253
I will no longer be a Young Lady,
but a Lady soon.

01:04:43.462 --> 01:04:47.133
Because soon I'll be married
to my betrothed, to your Young Master.

01:04:48.843 --> 01:04:51.387
Oh, yes.
Congratulations on the engagement.

01:04:51.470 --> 01:04:54.682
Being your master's wife makes me
your master as well.

01:04:56.100 --> 01:04:57.643
There's something you must do for me.

01:04:59.979 --> 01:05:01.606
First, you must carry this.

01:05:02.648 --> 01:05:03.858
What is this?

01:05:04.358 --> 01:05:07.320
[ominous music playing]

01:05:11.198 --> 01:05:12.408
[Mu-deok] What was that just now?

01:05:13.659 --> 01:05:14.827
Is that a broken stone?

01:05:17.830 --> 01:05:19.624
It's extremely precious.

01:05:20.499 --> 01:05:22.460
So if anything were to happen to it,

01:05:23.127 --> 01:05:24.712
you will take responsibility.

01:05:25.713 --> 01:05:27.423
[Mu-deok]
Is she telling me not to break something

01:05:27.506 --> 01:05:28.424
that is already broken?

01:05:29.300 --> 01:05:30.343
Please take that and follow me.

01:05:31.761 --> 01:05:32.595
Wait.

01:05:33.471 --> 01:05:35.306
You are not my master yet, my Lady.

01:05:36.015 --> 01:05:38.643
I must go to Young Master Jang
right now. Goodbye.

01:05:41.896 --> 01:05:42.855
[Cho-yeon scoffs]

01:05:43.439 --> 01:05:45.483
Did she just ignore me?

01:05:53.950 --> 01:05:55.785
Was what I just saw back there real?

01:06:03.042 --> 01:06:05.670
[ominous music playing]

01:06:06.545 --> 01:06:08.756
[Mu-deok] It is best that
I do not cross paths with him.

01:06:10.967 --> 01:06:12.468
[Cho-yeon] Hey! You!

01:06:14.971 --> 01:06:15.930
[Mu-deok] The dangerous man?

01:06:17.765 --> 01:06:19.225
Or the nasty wench?

01:06:20.810 --> 01:06:21.769
Oh, my Lady.

01:06:22.687 --> 01:06:25.064
Give that to me. I will carry it for you.

01:06:28.275 --> 01:06:29.360
[Cho-yeon] Very well.

01:06:29.443 --> 01:06:32.029
You must make sure it does not break.

01:06:36.617 --> 01:06:37.952
[Mu-deok] So it really is broken.

01:06:38.703 --> 01:06:40.496
She's trying to pin the blame on me.

01:07:09.692 --> 01:07:12.486
[Mu-deok] So,
this is the home of the Jin family.

01:07:15.781 --> 01:07:17.867
[muffled ringing]

01:07:26.834 --> 01:07:28.294
[objects clanging]

01:07:31.130 --> 01:07:33.549
[birds chirping frantically]

01:07:39.513 --> 01:07:41.098
[choral music playing]

01:07:44.602 --> 01:07:45.478
What?

01:07:58.324 --> 01:07:59.283
Mother.

01:08:01.827 --> 01:08:03.871
[choral music continues playing]

01:08:21.222 --> 01:08:22.765
[maid Kim] You cannot leave like this.

01:08:23.974 --> 01:08:25.434
Stand before your late mother's picture

01:08:25.518 --> 01:08:27.353
and promise that you will marry Lady Jin.

01:08:27.436 --> 01:08:29.980
It's the only way to protect
your father's position as the Gwanju.

01:08:32.483 --> 01:08:33.317
Maid Kim.

01:08:33.818 --> 01:08:34.777
Do you believe…

01:08:36.153 --> 01:08:38.280
that I am really
Gwanju Jang Gang's only son?

01:08:41.742 --> 01:08:43.119
Do you really know…

01:08:44.411 --> 01:08:46.080
who my biological father is?

01:08:47.915 --> 01:08:49.750
Why would you ask something like that?

01:08:50.334 --> 01:08:52.545
Of course you are the Gwanju's only son.

01:08:54.547 --> 01:08:56.674
Yes. That's what I believed
my entire life, too.

01:08:56.757 --> 01:08:58.592
[Jang Uk] I do not want to deny it now.

01:08:58.676 --> 01:08:59.552
So…

01:09:01.804 --> 01:09:03.722
I refuse to sit still and just do nothing.

01:09:05.266 --> 01:09:06.350
No matter what I do.…

01:09:07.852 --> 01:09:09.019
don't stop me, okay?

01:09:17.027 --> 01:09:20.156
Maidservant Kim,
someone from the Jin household is outside.

01:09:20.739 --> 01:09:23.075
From Jinyowon? What is this about?

01:09:23.159 --> 01:09:24.910
Something serious
has happened at Jinyowon.

01:09:25.494 --> 01:09:27.788
They request that Young Master Jang
hurries over right away.

01:09:27.872 --> 01:09:28.831
They're waiting for him.

01:09:28.914 --> 01:09:31.917
[pensive music playing]

01:10:09.538 --> 01:10:10.748
[Jang Uk] You've been looking for me?

01:10:10.831 --> 01:10:12.124
What is this all about?

01:10:12.708 --> 01:10:15.419
One of our treasures has disappeared.

01:10:16.295 --> 01:10:17.338
However…

01:10:18.756 --> 01:10:20.799
a specific person has disappeared with it.

01:10:28.307 --> 01:10:30.893
[Mu-deok] So this is
the renowned Jin family's Jinyowon.

01:10:39.360 --> 01:10:40.402
[mirror Mu-deok] Hey.

01:10:47.785 --> 01:10:49.203
So it really is you.

01:10:53.499 --> 01:10:54.917
It's been a while.

01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:57.795
[intense music playing]

01:11:09.390 --> 01:11:10.724
[water rippling]

01:11:12.810 --> 01:11:14.270
[eerie music playing]

01:11:25.364 --> 01:11:26.490
You mean to say…

01:11:27.616 --> 01:11:29.159
that Mu-deok has disappeared?

01:11:29.243 --> 01:11:30.619
[Ho-gyeong] Yes.

01:11:30.703 --> 01:11:32.037
That girl, Mu-deok, stole it.

01:11:32.830 --> 01:11:35.165
She took our yin-yang jade
and ran before anyone knew.

01:11:35.249 --> 01:11:37.293
[intense percussive music playing]

01:11:47.386 --> 01:11:50.264
["Aching" by Kassy playing]

01:12:07.364 --> 01:12:09.742
[mirror Mu-deok] I know you have been
thinking about me, Your Highness,

01:12:10.242 --> 01:12:11.201
so I came to see you.

01:12:11.702 --> 01:12:13.912
You were longing for
the one you met at Danhyanggok.

01:12:13.996 --> 01:12:15.331
[Seo Yul] What do you mean, "longing"?

01:12:15.414 --> 01:12:16.665
I would never.

01:12:16.749 --> 01:12:18.000
[Jang Uk] Would you please open it?

01:12:18.083 --> 01:12:21.045
The place of relics and artifacts.
Open the door to Jinyowon.

01:12:21.128 --> 01:12:23.422
[Ho-gyeong] You could become possessed
and trapped inside.

01:12:23.505 --> 01:12:25.049
- You're just too scared to touch that.
- [Go Won yelps]

01:12:26.550 --> 01:12:27.801
What was that?

01:12:28.385 --> 01:12:29.470
[Gil-ju] Bring Jang Uk to me.

01:12:29.553 --> 01:12:31.638
[Mu-deok] I must sacrifice you to survive.

01:12:31.722 --> 01:12:32.681
It is only right.

01:12:34.391 --> 01:12:36.435
[Seo Yul] Mu-deok is Naksu.

01:12:36.518 --> 01:12:37.728
[men grunt]

01:12:39.563 --> 01:12:41.565
[Mu-deok] Fight like your life
depends on it, my pupil.
